<main id="main" class="wrap">

  <p class="intro"><strong>LASP&rsquo;s Electrical Engineering role closes Saturday 10 October</strong>, and so does the Craig Huffman scholarship, the two nearest deadlines here. NIST SURF opens mid-October. York Space Systems, SpaceX and Stoke Space are open now and take first-years. EAA and AOPA run to mid and late December.</p>
