    <a class="card" href="https://bold.org/scholarships/by-major/engineering-scholarships/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="card-top"><p class="role">Engineering and STEM scholarship scan</p><span class="pay">Volume plays</span></div>
      <p class="org">Bold.org, one free profile applies to all</p>
      <p class="loc">Verified open 4 Sept &middot; eligibility: filter by education level so you only see ones a first-year can win</p>
      <p class="why">For volume rather than fit. Dozens of open engineering and STEM awards with real deadlines, many essay-only, all from the profile you already built for the Bold.org ones above. Filter to engineering, sort by deadline, set the education level to undergraduate, and knock out a few each month with the reusable drone-and-aerospace piece.</p>
      <p class="go">Open the Bold.org engineering list &rsaquo;</p>
